==Crimean Gothic==

===Etymology===
From {{der|gme-cgo|ira-pro|*hajáhram}}, from {{der|gme-cgo|ine-pro||*sm̥-ǵʰéslom}}, from {{m|ine-pro|*ǵʰéslom}}. The source is probably a {{der|gme-cgo|xsc|-}} language; compare {{cog|os|ӕрзӕ|pos=with metathesis}}. Compare further {{cog|ae|𐬵𐬀𐬰𐬀𐬢𐬭𐬀}}, {{cog|fa|هزار|tr=hezâr}}. See also {{m|gme-cgo|sada|t=hundred}}.

